# Agent guide (Orcan product)

**Orcan** = Docker **work-context orchestrator** (workspaces, path parity, context pack).
Agent CLIs (`agent`, `claude`, `codex`) are tools inside it — **models are out of scope**.

Display name: **Orcan**. Ids: `orcan`, `ORCAN_*`. Only product name in docs/UI text.

## 30-second map

| | |
| --- | --- |
| **SoT** | Root `AGENTS.md` (= `CLAUDE.md`) — keep them identical |
| **Public API** | `orcan` CLI — not Make; not deprecated user targets |
| **Config** | JSON `orcan.config.json`; `orcan sync` after edits (`up` does **not** sync) |
| **UX work** | `make dev-*` / `scripts/dev/` → `orcan:dev-ux` — not the user’s daily install |
| **Cockpit** | `cockpit/src/orcan_cockpit/` — top bar (rail + CPU/RAM/clock) \| left: workspaces + ASSERTIONS \| tmux + hints \| bottom: status; **F2** · **`r`** review · **`p`** pause · **`o`** off/on |
| **Image FS** | `docker/rootfs/` — repo `.cursor/rules/` ≠ image `cursor-defaults/` |
| **Checks** | `make validate` · `test-host` · `docs-check`; UX: `dev-restart` / `dev-smoke` / `dev-a11y` / `dev-visual` (`dev-checklist`) |

**Read next:** [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md), then
[`docs/en/ai/project-context.md`](../../docs/en/ai/project-context.md) /
