## Done checklist

- [ ] Surgical diff only
- [ ] `make validate` · `make test-host`
- [ ] `make docs-check` when docs/interface changed
- [ ] `make dev-restart` when validating cockpit/ttyd UX (isolated)
- [ ] `make dev-smoke` / `dev-a11y` / `dev-visual` when cockpit layout or browser chrome changed (see `make dev-checklist`)
- [ ] `make test` when Docker behaviour changed (if Docker available)
- [ ] If you change `AGENTS.md`, copy the same content to `CLAUDE.md`
- [ ] No secrets; report what ran / skipped / limits
- [ ] No AI commit trailers

